flowchart TD
    A([Provider and model registered]) --> B{Compatible fresh profile exists?}
    B -->|Yes| Z([Select immutable capability profile])
    B -->|No| C[Create disposable isolated probe workspace]
    C --> D{Required isolation ready?}
    D -->|No| X[Block profiling and use conservative fallback]
    D -->|Yes| E[Run fixed repeated probe matrix]
    E --> F{Probe transport succeeds?}
    F -->|No| G{Retry budget remains?}
    G -->|Yes| E
    G -->|No| X
    F -->|Yes| H[Collect raw traces and artifact digests]
    H --> I[Score protocol tool context edit and repetition]
    I --> J{Confidence threshold met?}
    J -->|No| K{Repeat budget remains?}
    K -->|Yes| E
    K -->|No| L[Build provisional conservative profile]
    J -->|Yes| M[Build empirical profile with provenance]
    L --> N[Run holdout validation]
    M --> N
    N --> O{Holdout passes?}
    O -->|No| P[Quarantine candidate and select fallback]
    P --> Z
    O -->|Yes| Q[Persist versioned profile and profiler receipt]
    Q --> Z
    X --> Z
